  id: Snow_Cabin_5
  headerName: "House Notes \u2014 5"
  content: "\tWe reached the tundra island. The surface looked dark and loose \u2014
    richer than the desert sand. We thought things might grow here. But when I pushed
    the spade down a few inches, it struck something as hard as iron. Permafrost."
